      "text": {
        "content": "\n    <p>Experiência dada ao Treinador por derrotar um Pokémon selvagem, cruzando o\n    <strong>nível</strong> do Pokémon derrotado com sua <strong>SR</strong> (já indicada no bloco\n    de estatísticas de cada espécie na Pokédex deste módulo). Capturar em vez de derrotar concede\n    apenas 1/5 desse valor.</p>\n    <table style='font-size:0.75rem'><thead><tr><th>Nível \\ SR</th><th>1/8</th><th>1/4</th><th>1/2</th><th>1</th><th>2</th><th>3</th><th>4</th><th>5</th><th>6</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>1º</strong></td><td>20</td><td>40</td><td>80</td><td>160</td><td>360</td><td>560</td><td>880</td><td>1,400</td><td>1,800</td></tr><tr><td><strong>2º</strong></td><td>40</td><td>80</td><td>160</td><td>360</td><td>560</td><td>880</td><td>1,400</td><td>1,800</td><td>2,300</td></tr><tr><td><strong>3º</strong></td><td>80</td><td>150</td><td>340</td><td>530</td><td>840</td><td>1,400</td><td>1,700</td><td>2,200</td><td>3,000</td></tr><tr><td><strong>4º</strong></td><td>140</td><td>320</td><td>500</td><td>790</td><td>1,300</td><td>1,700</td><td>2,100</td><td>2,800</td><td>3,600</td></tr><tr><td><strong>5º</strong></td><td>360</td><td>560</td><td>880</td><td>1,400</td><td>1,800</td><td>2,300</td><td>3,100</td><td>4,000</td><td>4,700</td></tr><tr><td><strong>6º</strong></td><td>530</td><td>840</td><td>1,400</td><td>1,700</td><td>2,200</td><td>3,000</td><td>3,800</td><td>4,500</td><td>5,500</td></tr><tr><td><strong>7º</strong></td><td>820</td><td>1,300</td><td>1,700</td><td>2,200</td><td>2,900</td><td>3,700</td><td>4,400</td><td>5,400</td><td>6,200</td></tr><tr><td><strong>8º</strong></td><td>1,300</td><td>1,700</td><td>2,100</td><td>2,800</td><td>3,600</td><td>4,300</td><td>5,200</td><td>6,100</td><td>7,300</td></tr><tr><td><strong>9º</strong></td><td>1,600</td><td>2,000</td><td>2,700</td><td>3,500</td><td>4,200</td><td>5,100</td><td>5,900</td><td>7,000</td><td>8,100</td></tr><tr><td><strong>10º</strong></td><td>2,300</td><td>3,100</td><td>4,000</td>